  "portal_description": "Red Hat JBoss Web Server is a fully integrated and certified set of components for hosting Java web applications. It is comprised of the Apache Tomcat Servlet container, JBoss HTTP Connector (mod_cluster), the PicketLink Vault extension for Apache Tomcat, and the Tomcat Native library.\n\nThis release of Red Hat JBoss Web Server 6.0.0 serves as a replacement for Red Hat JBoss Web Server 5.7.6. This release includes bug fixes, enhancements and component upgrades, which are documented in the Release Notes, linked to in the References section.",
